# EXCEPT the real Phase 2.5 bundle's original per-role judgment outputs: they are
# the tamper-evidence source of truth (judgment_hash_sha256 verifies against them;
# regression test R3 depends on them). V3 (D052_PREMERGE_SEMANTIC_CLEANUP_V3): the
# former whole-directory negation was OVER-BROAD; it is narrowed to a strict
# per-file allowlist — parent dir re-included, directory contents ignored by
# default, only the 21 tracked evidence files re-included by exact name. Any
# FUTURE file placed here stays ignored until explicitly allowlisted. Machine
# list + SHA256 + secret/checkpoint scan verdict:
# gpu1_aggregation_siege/reports/phase25/frozen_output_allowlist.json
# No secrets allowed: env-var NAMES only, never credential VALUES; no checkpoints.
